{"4945250": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Chaos Football Club", "steam_appid": 4945250, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaos Football Club throws two teams of seven into a walled arena where the sidelines bounce the ball straight back into play. There are no throw-ins and no cards here — just fast, end-to-end action built around wall passes, ricochet goals, and charged shots off the glass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7v7 matches (GK + 2 DEF + 2 MID + 2 ATT) on a walled arena, with 3-minute matches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-driven ball with wall bounces, deflections, dribble assist, and charged shots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special powers with cooldowns: Shield, Super Shot, and Dash</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knockout tackles that floor opponents for a couple of seconds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Role-based AI covering pressing, marking, forward runs, and keeper distribution</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 formations and 5 live tactics, ranging from defensive to full-on pressing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Corners and goal kicks with a last-touch rule, plus golden goal in knockout matches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wall Goal bonus XP when the ball clips a wall before scoring</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A World Cup tournament with 8 fictional teams, 2 groups, semis, and a final</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persistent progression: XP, levels, upgrade points, gold, stat upgrades, and ball-trail cosmetics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from eight teams — Solar Kingdom, Frostland FC, Neo Brazilia, Iron Albion, Crimson Italia, Dragon Japan, Emerald Isles, and Cyber Germany — each with its own identity, stat biases, and preferred formation.</p><